  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Speedway**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **Welcome to Hell**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **Chondromalacia Patella**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **Sugar/Tzu**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **Eat Men Eat**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **John L**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **Slow**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **Honey/Sleep Drifter**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **kglw2022-10-21.BOOTS** (recommended): source not stated; 22 songs; 137 min [1]\n- **kglw2022-10-21.p170**: audience recording; 13 songs; 88 min [2]. Said about its sound: The recording exhibits excessive noise and phasing issues, with channels normalized to -23 LUFS [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Leah Senior and Black Midi performed as guests at the Forest Hills Stadium show [1]\n- Security personnel intervened to catch crowd surfers during the performance [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **kglw2022-10-21.BOOTS**: Audio was captured using a Shure MX88 microphone connected to an iPhone 14 [1]\n- **kglw2022-10-21.p170**: taped by Evan Gorski; source: AUD [2]. Also: Recording used AKG P170 mics into a UMC204HD interface and Raspberry Pi 3B [2]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by KGLW.net: [King Gizzard & the Lizard Wizard setlist - 2022-10-21 Forest Hills Stadium, Queens, NY, USA](https://kglw.net/setlists/king-gizzard-the-lizard-wizard-october-21-2022-forest-hills-stadium-queens-ny-usa.html) [4]\n- Poster by educationsurvey.steelcase.com: [King Gizzard Forest Hills Poster - Minimalist Poster Store](https://educationsurvey.steelcase.com/poster/king-gizzard-forest-hills-poster.html) [5]",
